Proposes the reply-format change for the desktop chat client.

The reply is rendered by the Minimax Code desktop client, which supports bold,
italics and ordered/unordered lists. It does not render tables, coloured text or
flag glyphs. The shared DELIVERY block nevertheless mandates a markdown table for
3+ comparable numeric rows.

This replaces the DELIVERY section of cloud-prompts/_shared/PROMPT-BLOCKS.md only.
No skill logic changes, no threshold changes, no artifact format changes - the
artifact keeps its tables and its glyphs, because GitHub renders both.

Apply with:
  git apply maxhermes-client-render.patch
or, from the migration repo root:
  git apply -p1 refs/maxhermes-client-render.patch

