+  300-character line with two em-dashes and three numbers — split it into two bullets, or move
+  the detail to the artifact file. When a bullet is over the cap, split it at a clause
+  boundary (a semicolon, a colon, a dash, or a comma that is not inside brackets), never
+  mid-sentence.
